            {
              "id": "1769497198477_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## JOB TITLE LIST\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.jobList}}\n\n## INSTRUCTIONS\nYour task is to create marketing copy aimed at candidates for the {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.companyName}} career site to describe the job category for {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.jobCategories}} based on the job titles of available jobs in the job title list above.\n\nDon't include the job titles directly in the generated text. Instead, focus on generating text to include work experience, skills, and opportunities that are relevant to these jobs. DO NOT talk about benefits and compensation.\n\n## KEY RULES:\n- Response should be a plain text without any formatting.\n- Keep the response in paragraph format with a maximum of 3 paragraphs.\n- Response MUST NOT exceed 500 words.\n\nMULTILINGUAL OUTPUT ENFORCEMENT\n- All responses must be entirely in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}}\n- Translate all static or hardcoded text before output.\n- Do not use any other language except required proper nouns.\n- If {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}} is empty, default to English."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
      "variables": [],
